    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303670/extras/af42a8c4402f36826e02205f968841fa.poster.avif?t=1752931014\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303670/extras/af42a8c4402f36826e02205f968841fa.webm?t=1752931014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303670/extras/af42a8c4402f36826e02205f968841fa.mp4?t=1752931014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewind back to 2004 and find out why Lou and her friends went missing. Or did they?\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 initial traits to choose from - </strong>are you more athletic, resourceful or perceptive?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And an additional disorder\u00a0</strong>- you can be scared of the dark, sleep deprived or have terrifying intrusive thoughts... not for the faint of hearts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And an additional additional skill, even</strong> - pick an optional course (geography, history, latin, many more!) which provides some side content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comic book panels - </strong>walk, run, sneak around in a 3D world, and experience every interaction in hand-drawn comic book panels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery  - </strong>why did so many people disappear from Noirmont High with no trace?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nostalgic soundtrack and ambient\u00a0</strong>\u00a0-<strong>\u00a0</strong>a good old 80s vibe everywhere you look (even though we're in the 2000s)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not a dating sim... or? </strong>- nahhh</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303670/extras/af42a8c4402f36826e02205f968841fa.poster.avif?t=1752931014\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303670/extras/af42a8c4402f36826e02205f968841fa.webm?t=1752931014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303670/extras/af42a8c4402f36826e02205f968841fa.mp4?t=1752931014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewind back to 2004 and find out why Lou and her friends went missing. Or did they?\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 initial traits to choose from - </strong>are you more athletic, resourceful or perceptive?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And an additional disorder\u00a0</strong>- you can be scared of the dark, sleep deprived or have terrifying intrusive thoughts... not for the faint of hearts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And an additional additional skill, even</strong> - pick an optional course (geography, history, latin, many more!) which provides some side content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comic book panels - </strong>walk, run, sneak around in a 3D world, and experience every interaction in hand-drawn comic book panels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery  - </strong>why did so many people disappear from Noirmont High with no trace?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nostalgic soundtrack and ambient\u00a0</strong>\u00a0-<strong>\u00a0</strong>a good old 80s vibe everywhere you look (even though we're in the 2000s)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not a dating sim... or? </strong>- nahhh</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
